c mutations (or homozygous or heterozygous forms).\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/basis_in_disruption_of_process.yaml:7:  A pattern for generic groupings of diseases based around the molecular basis for\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/carcinoma.yaml:13:  We use the generic ''disease has location'' relation, which generalized over primary\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml:1:pattern_name: disease_series_by_gene\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml:3:pattern_iri: http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/mondo/patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml:6:  a single gene, that have gene-based names, such as new disease terms that are requested\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml:18:  gene: SO:0000704\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml:29:  gene: '''gene'''\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml:35:  - gene\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml:41:  - gene\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml:46:  - gene\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml:52:  - gene\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml:55:  text: Any %s in which the cause of the disease is a variation in the %s gene.\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml:58:  - gene\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/disease_series_by_gene.yaml:64:  - gene\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/benign.yaml:8:  generic neoplasm class. For example, a benign adrenal gland pheochromocytoma, defined\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/benign.yaml:9:  as being the benign form of the more general adrenal gland pheochromocytoma.\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/rhabdomyosarcoma.yaml:5:description: 'This is auto-generated. Add your description here\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/small_cell_carcinoma.yaml:5:description: 'This is auto-generated. Add your description here\nsrc/patterns/dosdp-patterns/isolated.yaml:10:  the isolated/syndromic-